    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d91">

                <pb facs="0148" n="882" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg882"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Young.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-03-19"><hi rendition="#italic">March 19,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Naval investigation establishes Renton’s murder. Urge Honduras Government to take
                    prompt action lest delay enable guilty parties to escape punishment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Uhl</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
